8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/21123.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-2465.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0109","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-1331","title":"Microsoft Office PNG 文件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2003 SP3 及 Office 2011 for Mac 的 PNG 图片解析组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 Office 文档包含特制的 PNG 图像数据时，程序在内存分配过程中未能正确校验数据长度，导致缓冲区溢出。攻击者可利用此漏洞诱使用户打开恶意 Office 文档，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-1331"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-06-12T03:29:57Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:51:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-051 提供的更新：Office 2003 SP3 用户安装 KB2817421（下载地址 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=1acd93fa-e6d6-44b1-86de-4fbb464d0e6c），Office for Mac 2011 用户升级至 14.3.5 版本（下载 KB2848689）。如无法立即打补丁，建议不要打开来源不明的 Office 文档，并启用 EMET（Enhanced Mitigation Experience Toolkit）缓解利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-168A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-051","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16713","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16732","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-1331","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-1331.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2013/1xxx/CVE-2013-1331.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-1331","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2013/1xxx/CVE-2013-1331.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-1331.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-1331.html","https://github.com/inverse-inc/packetfence/blob/e3d449fa3dffae7114371a08a62277ed31dc7111/conf/suricata_categories.txt.example","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2013/CVE-2013-1331.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-1331.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h8gm-f3pp-ppg9/GHSA-h8gm-f3pp-ppg9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0308","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3660","title":"Microsoft Windows win32k.sys 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 内核模式驱动 win32k.sys 中的 EPATHOBJ::pprFlattenRec 函数在初始化 PATHRECORD 链中下一对象的指针时存在缺陷，导致本地攻击者可通过触发分页内存的过度消耗并大量调用 FlattenPath 函数，从而获取对 PATHRECORD 链的写入权限，最终实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8 及 Server 2012 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可获取 SYSTEM 权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3660"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-05-24T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:55:35Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2013 年 4 月安全公告 MS13-036 提供的更新补丁（KB2823324），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。对于 Windows 8 及 Windows Server 2012 等受支持系统，安装 MS13-046 累积更新（KB2829361）。对于已停止支持的 Windows XP/2003/Vista/2008/7 系统，微软不再提供安全更新，建议升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016/2022 等受支持版本；如无法升级，应限制低权限用户本地登录，并部署端点检测与响应（EDR）产品监控异常 win32k 调用行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2013-05/0090.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2013-05/0094.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2013-06/0006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/53435","http://twitter.com/taviso/statuses/309157606247768064","http://twitter.com/taviso/statuses/335557286657400832","http://www.computerworld.com/s/article/9239477","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/25611/","http://www.osvdb.org/93539","http://www.reddit.com/r/netsec/comments/1eqh66/0day_windows_kernel_epathobj_vulnerability/","http://www.theverge.com/2013/5/23/4358400/google-engineer-bashes-microsoft-discloses-windows-flaw","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-190A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-053","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17360","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3660","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3660.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-3660.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/012af80ac1ad84254f795c650e791a702734e1a5/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2013-3660.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2013-3660/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2013-3660.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-3660","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/C