2013-1347","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 8 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 8 在处理内存对象时存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，具体位于 CGenericElement 对象的虚函数表（vtable）中。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，诱使用户通过 IE8 访问，触发已释放内存对象的访问，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞在 2013 年 5 月已被野外利用，影响 Windows 平台上的 IE8 浏览器，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-1347"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-05-05T11:07:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:51:15Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-038 提供的更新 KB2847204。Windows XP/Vista/7 用户可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。同时必须安装 MS13-037（Internet Explorer 累积安全更新）以避免兼容性问题。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，可启用 EMET（增强缓解体验工具包）并配置与 IE 联动，或将 Internet 安全区域设置为「高」以阻止 ActiveX 控件和 Active Scripting，或应用 Microsoft Fix it 解决方案 \"CVE-2013-1347 MSHTML Shim Workaround\" 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2847140","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/25294","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-134A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-038","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16727","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-1347","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/25294","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-1347.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2013/1xxx/CVE-2013-1347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-1347","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2013/1xxx/CVE-2013-1347.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-1347/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/exp-sky/Blog/blob/b5ad8a245c5b79fc3cd438b45d2ee23160a0e688/CVE-2013-1347_Analysis/CVE-2013-1347_Analysis.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-1347.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-1347.html","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/shrike/blob/1becbaf9b518f780cca746c56d6e153e8505fc68/packs.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0206","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2423","title":"Oracle Java SE HotSpot 类型混淆权限绕过漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 7 Update 17及更早版本中的Java运行时环境（JRE）HotSpot组件存在类型混淆漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱使用户访问恶意网页，触发Java Applet中的反射类型混淆漏洞，利用MethodHandles方法绕过Java安全沙箱的权限检查机制，通过反射修改任意public final字段（如整型和双精度浮点型字段），最终禁用Security Manager安全管理器，实现完全沙箱逃逸。该漏洞影响Oracle Java SE 7及OpenJDK 7，攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互（访问恶意页面），但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。该漏洞已被CISA列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），且已有公开的Metasploit利用模块。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2423"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-04-17T18:55:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:20Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle Java SE 至 7 Update 21 及以上版本，或安装 Oracle 2013 年 4 月关键补丁更新 (CPU)。对于无法立即升级的环境，建议在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 或卸载 Java 运行时环境 (JRE) 以消除攻击面。OpenJDK 7 用户应更新至包含安全修复的最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.fuseyism.com/index.php/2013/04/22/security-icedtea-2-3-9-for-openjdk-7-released/","http://blog.spiderlabs.com/2013/04/java-is-so-confusing.html","http://hg.openjdk.java.net/jdk7u/jdk7u-dev/jdk/rev/b453d9be6b3f","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2013-06/msg00099.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0752.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0757.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","http://weblog.ikvm.net/PermaLink.aspx?guid=acd2dd6d-1028-4996-95df-efa42ac237f0","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24976","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:161","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpuapr2013-1928497.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1806-1","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-107A","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=952398","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16700","https://wiki.mageia.org/en/Support/Advisories/MGASA-2013-0130","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-2423","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24976","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2423.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-2423","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2423.json","https://github.com/buffer/thug/blob/c6776b2b9d44228772c76cc8b82218a395c764ad/thug/DOM/DFT.py","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-2423.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-2423.html","https://github.com/inverse-inc/packetfence/blob/e3d449fa3dffae7114371a08a62277ed31dc7111/conf/suricata_categories.txt.example","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2013/CVE-2013-2423.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0206.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0206.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0018","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2596","title":"Linux Kernel 帧缓冲设备整数溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drivers/video/fbmem.c 文件中的 fb_mmap 函数存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），当用户通过 /dev/graphics/fb0 设备文件调用 mmap2 系统调用时，由于对内存映射大小计算不当导致整数溢出，使得本地攻击者能够创建覆盖整个内核内存的读写映射，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 3.8.9 之前版本，被用于 Motorola Android 4.1.2 等设备中。攻击者只需拥有本地低权限账户即可触发，无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低。Motochopper 利用程序已公开该漏洞的完整利用方法，攻击者可通过该漏洞完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2596"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-04-13T02:59:46Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:41Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 3.8.9 及以上版本（对应提交 b4cbb197c7e7 和 fc9bbca8f650），或安装厂商提供的安全补丁。对于 Motorola Android 设备，请更新官方固件至已修复版本。临时缓解措施：限制对 /dev/graphics/fb0 设备的访问权限，禁止非 root 用户执行 mmap2 系统调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://forum.xda-developers.com/showthread.php?t=2255491","http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=b4cbb197c7e7a68dbad0d491242e3ca67420c13e","http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=fc9bbca8f650e5f738af8806317c0a041a48ae4a","http://kb.juniper.net/InfoCenter/index?page=content&id=JSA10761","http://marc.info/?l=linux-kernel&m=136616837923938&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-0695.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-0782.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-0803.html","http://www.droid-life.com/2013/04/09/root-method-released-for-droid-razr-hd-running-android-4-1-2-other-devices-too/","http://www.droidrzr.com/index.php/topic/15208-root-motochopper-yet-another-android-root-exploit/","http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/ChangeLog-3.8.9","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:176","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/linuxbulletinjan2016-2867209.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/59264","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/b4cbb197c7e7a68dbad0d491242e3ca67420c13e","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/fc9bbca8f650e5f738af8806317c0a041a48ae4a","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-2596","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2596.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-2596.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-2596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2596.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2013/CVE-2013-2596.yaml","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/e8fb8c8d4f5de912b7778f3aec7367ca61a10f66/2013/README.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2013/UBUNTU-CVE-2013-2596.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-2596.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-2596.html","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2013-2596.json","https://github.com/hiikezoe/libfb_mem_exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0022","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0074","title":"Microsoft Silverlight 双重解引用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Silverlight 5 及 5 Developer Runtime 在 5.1.20125.0 之前版本中存在双重解引用（Double Dereference）漏洞。该漏洞源于 Silverlight 在渲染 HTML 对象时未能正确验证指针，导致攻击者可以构造恶意的 Silverlight 应用程序，诱使用户访问包含恶意内容的网页，从而触发内存访问错误，最终实现远程代码执行。攻击成功后可完全控制受影响的系统，获取与当前用户相同的权限。该漏洞需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开邮件附件）才能触发，影响安装了 Silverlight 5 的所有 Windows 平台。Microsoft 已在 2013 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0074"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-03-13T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:48:44Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-022 (KB2814124) 提供的更新，将 Silverlight 升级至 5.1.20125.0 或更高版本。Windows 用户可通过 Microsoft Update 自动获取更新，或从 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=75eef049-1f39-47b4-9a1e-839974fc89b9 手动下载安装。Mac 用户可通过 Silverlight 自动更新功能或下载 Silverlight.dmg 安装。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表设置 Silverlight ActiveX 控件 kill bit（CLSID: {DFEAF541-F3E1-4C24-ACAC-99C30715084A}）临时禁用 Silverlight 插件作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-071A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-022","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16516","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16565","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0074","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/29858","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-0074.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/d75602d5d73a4ef9fa4ca11c272cc294416a70e1/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/MSIL/Exploit/CVE-2013-0074.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0074.json","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2013-0074.lua","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/BAT/CVE-2013-0074/Exploit_BAT_CVE-2013-0074_I.yar","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules_index.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-0074","https://github.com/omriher/CapTipper/blob/3fb2836c0afe60eb6bd5902b4214f564268e9b4d/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/27390.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0022.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0022.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0209","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2551","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6至10版本中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当IE访问已删除的CSS样式表对象时，由于对象引用未正确清理，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发对已释放内存的访问，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞在CanSecWest 2013的Pwn2Own大赛中被VUPEN团队公开演示，影响范围广泛。攻击者成功利用后可获得与当前用户相同的系统权限，完全控制受影响系统。Microsoft已在安全公告MS13-009中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2551"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-03-11T10:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:36Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-009 提供的累积安全更新 KB2792100，该更新通过修改 Internet Explorer 处理内存中对象的方式修复了此释放后使用漏洞。受影响系统包括 Windows XP/Vista/7/8 及 Server 2003/2008/2008 R2/2012 上的 IE6 至 IE10。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。对于无法立即打补丁的环境，建议升级到更高版本 IE 或使用 Edge 浏览器替代，并在服务器上启用增强安全配置 (ESC) 以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://h30499.www3.hp.com/t5/HP-Security-Research-Blog/Pwn2Own-2013/ba-p/5981157","http://twitter.com/VUPEN/statuses/309479075385327617","http://twitter.com/thezdi/statuses/309452625173176320","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-134A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-037","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16317","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-2551","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/26175","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2551.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2551.json","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B]Internet%20Explorer%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%20(%E4%BA%8C)%E2%80%94%E2%80%94CVE-2013-2551.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-2551","https://github.com/3xp10it/myblog/blob/e31eab9c510946979c7b12ea82149a31e6de98b1/_posts/2016-12-27-%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89-cve-2013-2551.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2551.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-2551/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-2551.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-2551.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0209.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0209.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0108","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0648","title":"Adobe Flash Player 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 的 ExternalInterface ActionScript 功能存在未指定的远程代码执行漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 SWF 文件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Mac OS X 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.67 之前版本及 11.6.602.171 之前的 11.x 版本，以及 Linux 平台上的 10.3.183.67 之前版本及 11.2.202.273 之前的 11.x 版本。攻击者需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开恶意文件）才能成功利用，该漏洞已在 2013 年 2 月被野外利用，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0648"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-02-27T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至以下安全版本：Windows/Mac 升级至 10.3.183.67 或 11.6.602.171，Linux 升级至 10.3.183.67 或 11.2.202.273。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持并结束生命周期，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 组件，并在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，同时移除系统内所有 .swf 文件关联，以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-02/msg00025.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-02/msg00026.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-02/msg00035.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0574.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb13-08.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0648","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-0648","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985